hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1287","Abu Hurayra related"
"1288","Shahr ibn Hawshab said"
"1289","Anas ibn Malik said"
"1290","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1291","Anas said"
"1292","'Abdullah said"
"1293","Bilal ibn Sa'd al-Ash'ari related that Mu'awiya wrote to Abu Dharr"
"1294","'Abdul-'Aziz ibn Qays said"
"1295","circumcision"
"1296","circumcision"
"1297","Similar to 1292."
"1298","Abu't-Tufayl reported"
"1299","Al-Mughira ibn Shu'ba reported that a man said"
"1300","Ibrahim said"
"1301","Abu 'Uqba said"
"1302","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"1303","Abu Hurayra said"
"1304","Al-Hasan said"
"1305","Zayd ibn Thabit reported that 'Umar ibn al-Khattab came to him\nto ask to see him one day and he gave him permission while his head was\nin the hands of a slavegirl of his who was combing his hair. He removed\nhis head and 'Umar said to him"
"1306","Abu Hurayra said"
"1307","Habib ibn Abi Thabit said"
"1308","Ibn Abi'l-Hudhayl said"
"1309","Nafi' reported that a group of the people of Iraq visited Ibn\n'Umar. They saw a gold crown on one of their servants and looked at one\nanother. He remarked"
